{"id":"criatura","lemma":"criatura","pos":"noun","rank":1640,"glosses":["creature (living being), critter","small child, infant"],"ipa":"/kɾjaˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"criaturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-criatura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él observó muchos tipos de criaturas allí.","en":"He observed many types of creatures there.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to observe, to eye","l":"observar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"kind","l":"tipo"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"El dragón es una criatura imaginaria.","en":"The dragon is an imaginary creature.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568140","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dragon"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"imaginary","l":"imaginario"}]},{"text":"Las serpientes son criaturas de sangre fría.","en":"Snakes are cold-blooded creatures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687567","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"snake, serpent","l":"serpiente"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"cold-blooded"]]},{"text":"Los dragones son criaturas fabulosas.","en":"Dragons are fictional creatures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/559091","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dragon","l":"dragón"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"fable, myth, legend","l":"fabuloso"}]},{"text":"Los gatos son criaturas curiosas por naturaleza.","en":"Cats are curious creatures by nature.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"cat","l":"gato"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"curious, inquisitive","l":"curioso"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"nature"}]}]}